[5.043,"o","\r\n=== SAP LLM Gateway Kyma Deployment (Mesh at the Edge) ===\r\n\r\nThis deployment uses the \"Mesh at the Edge\" pattern:\r\n- Edge services with sidecars: nginx, oauth2-proxy (for ingress gateway connectivity)\r\n- Dex runs WITHOUT sidecar (disabled to prevent communication issues)\r\n- Backend services (gateway, admin, postgres, valkey) run WITHOUT sidecars\r\n- Namespace uses PERMISSIVE mTLS for mixed mesh/non-mesh communication\r\n\r\n🔒 Deployment configuration loaded and environment variable cleared\r\n\r\nNamespace: sail-proxy-test (manifests: <redacted>)\r\n\r\n"]
