[11.932,"o","No connectivity-proxy-tunnel Gateway found, skipping cp allowlist (no SCC tunnel in this cluster)\r\n\r\nStep 4: Configuring Istio sidecar injection for services...\r\n\r\nEdge services with sidecars: nginx, oauth2-proxy (for ingress gateway)\r\nEdge service without sidecar: dex (disabled for communication fix)\r\nBackend services (no sidecars): gateway, admin, postgres, valkey\r\n\r\nStep 5: Applying all manifests in correct order...\r\n\r\nApplying secrets individually to ensure proper creation...\r\n\r\nApplying admin-env.yaml...\r\n"]
