[275.402,"o","{\r\n    \"apiVersion\": \"networking.istio.io/v1\",\r\n    \"kind\": \"VirtualService\",\r\n    \"metadata\": {\r\n        \"annotations\": {\r\n            \"kubectl.kubernetes.io/last-applied-configuration\": \"{\\\"apiVersion\\\":\\\"networking.istio.io/v1beta1\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"VirtualService\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"annotations\\\":{},\\\"labels\\\":{\\\"app\\\":\\\"sail-proxy\\\",\\\"issue\\\":\\\"claude-code-timeouts\\\",\\\"purpose\\\":\\\"streaming-optimization\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"sail-proxy-streaming\\\",\\\"namespace\\\":\\\"sail-proxy-test\\\"},\\\"spec\\\":{\\\"gateways\\\":[\\\"kyma-system/kyma-gateway\\\"],\\\"hosts\\\":[\\\"sail.example.com\\\"],\\\"http\\\":[{\\\"headers\\\":{\\\"request\\\":{\\\"set\\\":{\\\"x-forwarded-host\\\":\\\"sail.example.com\\\"}},\\\"response\\\":{\\\"remove\\\":[\\\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Expose-Headers\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Allow-Headers\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Allow-Methods\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Max-Age\\\"]}},\\\"match\\\":[{\\\"uri\\\":{\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"/gateway/anthropic/v1/messages\\\"}}],\\\"retries\\\":{\\\"attempts\\\":0},\\\"route\\\":[{\\\"destination\\\":{\\\"host\\\":\\\"nginx.sail-proxy-test.svc.cluster.local\\\",\\\"port\\\":{\\\"number\\\":8080}},\\\"weight\\\":100}],\\\"timeout\\\":\\\"86400s\\\"},{\\\"headers\\\":{\\\"request\\\":{\\\"set\\\":{\\\"x-forwarded-host\\\":\\\"sail.example.com\\\"}},\\\"response\\\":{\\\"remove\\\":[\\\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Expose-Headers\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Allow-Headers\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Allow-Methods\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Max-Age\\\"]}},\\\"match\\\":[{\\\"uri\\\":{\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"/gateway/google/\\\"}}],\\\"retries\\\":{\\\"attempts\\\":0},\\\"route\\\":[{\\\"destination\\\":{\\\"host\\\":\\\"nginx.sail-proxy-test.svc.cluster.local\\\",\\\"port\\\":{\\\"number\\\":8080}},\\\"weight\\\":100}],\\\"timeout\\\":\\\"86400s\\\"},{\\\"headers\\\":{\\\"request\\\":{\\\"set\\\":{\\\"x-forwarded-host\\\":\\\"sail.example.com\\\"}},\\\"response\\\":{\\\"remove\\\":[\\\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Expose-Headers\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Allow-Headers\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Allow-Methods\\\",\\\"Access-Control-Max-Age\\\"]}},\\\"match\\\":[{\\\"uri\\\":{\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"/gateway/openai/v1/chat/completions\\\"}}],\\\"retries\\\":{\\\"attempts\\\":0},\\\"route\\\":[{\\\"destination\\\":{\\\"host\\\":\\\"nginx.sail-proxy-test.svc.cluster.local\\\",\\\"port\\\":{\\\"number\\\":8080}},\\\"weight\\\":100}],\\\"timeout\\\":\\\"86400s\\\"},{\\\"headers\\\":{\\\"request\\\":{\\\"set\\\":{\\\"x-forwarded-host\\\":\\\"sail.example.com\\\"}}},\\\"match\\\":[{\\\"uri\\\":{\\\"prefix\\\":\\\"/\\\"}}],\\\"route\\\":[{\\\"destination\\\":{\\\"host\\\":\\\"nginx.sail-proxy-test.svc.cluster.local\\\",\\\"port\\\":{\\\"number\\\":8080}},\\\"weight\\\":100}]}]}}\\n\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"creationTimestamp\": \"2026-10-21T01:15:13Z\",\r\n        \"generation\": 1,\r\n        \"labels\": {\r\n            \"app\": \"sail-proxy\",\r\n            \"issue\": \"claude-code-timeouts\",\r\n            \"purpose\": \"streaming-optimization\"\r\n        },\r\n        \"name\": \"sail-proxy-streaming\",\r\n        \"namespace\": \"sail-proxy-test\",\r\n        \"resourceVersion\": \"384992896\",\r\n        \"uid\": \"7002eac2-9dcb-47cd-9e27-33412f2febb4\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"spec\": {\r\n        \"gateways\": [\r\n            \"kyma-system/kyma-gateway\"\r\n        ],\r\n        \"hosts\": [\r\n            \"sail.example.com\"\r\n        ],\r\n        \"http\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"headers\": {\r\n                    \"request\": {\r\n                        \"set\": {\r\n                            \"x-forwarded-host\": \"sail.example.com\"\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    \"response\": {\r\n                        \"remove\": [\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Expose-Headers\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Allow-Headers\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Allow-Methods\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Max-Age\"\r\n                        ]\r\n                    }\r\n                },\r\n                \"match\": [\r\n                    {\r\n                        \"uri\": {\r\n                            \"prefix\": \"/gateway/anthropic/v1/messages\"\r\n                        }\r\n                    }\r\n                ],\r\n                \"retries\": {\r\n                    \"attempts\": 0\r\n                },\r\n                \"route\": [\r\n                    {\r\n                        \"destination\": {\r\n                            \"host\": \"nginx.sail-proxy-test.svc.cluster.local\",\r\n                            \"port\": {\r\n                                \"number\": 8080\r\n                            }\r\n                        },\r\n                        \"weight\": 100\r\n                    }\r\n                ],\r\n                \"timeout\": \"86400s\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"headers\": {\r\n                    \"request\": {\r\n                        \"set\": {\r\n                            \"x-forwarded-host\": \"sail.example.com\"\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    \"response\": {\r\n                        \"remove\": [\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Expose-Headers\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Allow-Headers\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Allow-Methods\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Max-Age\"\r\n                        ]\r\n                    }\r\n                },\r\n                \"match\": [\r\n                    {\r\n                        \"uri\": {\r\n                            \"prefix\": \"/gateway/google/\"\r\n                        }\r\n                    }\r\n                ],\r\n                \"retries\": {\r\n                    \"attempts\": 0\r\n                },\r\n                \"route\": [\r\n                    {\r\n                        \"destination\": {\r\n                            \"host\": \"nginx.sail-proxy-test.svc.cluster.local\",\r\n                            \"port\": {\r\n                                \"number\": 8080\r\n                            }\r\r\n                        },\r\n                        \"weight\": 100\r\n                    }\r\n                ],\r\n                \"timeout\": \"86400s\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"headers\": {\r\n                    \"request\": {\r\n                        \"set\": {\r\n                            \"x-forwarded-host\": \"sail.example.com\"\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    \"response\": {\r\n                        \"remove\": [\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Expose-Headers\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Allow-Headers\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Allow-Methods\",\r\n                            \"Access-Control-Max-Age\"\r\n                        ]\r\n                    }\r\n                },\r\n                \"match\": [\r\n                    {\r\n                        \"uri\": {\r\n                            \"prefix\": \"/gateway/openai/v1/chat/completions\"\r\n                        }\r\n                    }\r\n                ],\r\n                \"retries\": {\r\n                    \"attempts\": 0\r\n                },\r\n                \"route\": [\r\n                    {\r\n                        \"destination\": {\r\n                            \"host\": \"nginx.sail-proxy-test.svc.cluster.local\",\r\n                            \"port\": {\r\n                                \"number\": 8080\r\n                            }\r\n                        },\r\n                        \"weight\": 100\r\n                    }\r\n                ],\r\n                \"timeout\": \"86400s\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"headers\": {\r\n                    \"request\": {\r\n                        \"set\": {\r\n                            \"x-forwarded-host\": \"sail.example.com\"\r\n                        }\r\n                    }\r\n                },\r\n                \"match\": [\r\n                    {\r\n                        \"uri\": {\r\n                            \"prefix\": \"/\"\r\n                        }\r\n                    }\r\n                ],\r\n                \"route\": [\r\n                    {\r\n                        \"destination\": {\r\n                            \"host\": \"nginx.sail-proxy-test.svc.cluster.local\",\r\n                            \"port\": {\r\n                                \"number\": 8080\r\n                            }\r\n                        },\r\n                        \"weight\": 100\r\n                    }\r\n                ]\r\n            }\r\n        ]\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nGetting Gateway details...\r\n\r\n✅ VirtualService deployment detected (streaming-optimized)\r\n\r\n✅ Deployment successful!\r\n\r\n🚀 VirtualService-based deployment with streaming optimizations:\r\n  - Enhanced streaming support for Claude and OpenAI endpoints\r\n  - Disabled retries and extended timeouts for AI model responses\r\n  - HTTP/1.1 enforcement for better streaming compatibility\r\n\r\nTo find your application URL, check:\r\nkubectl -n sail-proxy-test get gateway -o yaml\r\n\r\n=== Deployment completed ===\r\n\r\nMesh-at-Edge Pattern Summary:\r\n- Namespace has PERMISSIVE mTLS (mixed mesh/non-mesh communication allowed)\r\n- Edge services with sidecars: nginx (2/2), oauth2-proxy (2/2)\r\n- Edge service without sidecar: dex (1/1) - sidecar disabled to fix communication\r\n- Backend services (gateway, admin, postgres, valkey) run without sidecars (1/1)\r\n- DestinationRules disable mTLS to non-mesh services\r\n\r\nNext steps:\r\n1. Verify pod status: kubectl -n sail-proxy-test get pods\r\n   - nginx, oauth2-proxy should show 2/2 (app + sidecar)\r\n   - dex, gateway, admin should show 1/1 (app only)\r\n2. Check ingress status: kubectl -n sail-proxy-test get virtualservice,gateway\r\n3. Test external access from your whitelisted IP\r\n4. Monitor logs: kubectl -n sail-proxy-test logs -f deployment/admin\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting:\r\n- If services can't communicate, check: kubectl -n sail-proxy-test get peerauthentication\r\n- If ingress fails, ensure nginx has sidecar: kubectl -n sail-proxy-test get pod -l app=nginx\r\n$ "]
